The MIT licence above covers the application code in this repository.

The DATA in data/kainga_ora_housing_public.duckdb is derived from New Zealand
government publications released under Creative Commons Attribution licences
(CC BY 3.0 NZ and CC BY 4.0), specifically:

  - Kāinga Ora – Homes and Communities: quarterly housing statistics
  - Ministry of Social Development: Housing Register and housing support statistics
  - Ministry of Housing and Urban Development: Public Housing Quarterly Report
  - MBIE / Tenancy Services: rental bond data

Attribution to those agencies is required when redistributing the derived data.
Synthetic tables (schema SYN) are generated and describe no real property,
tenancy, household or applicant.

This project is independent. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
produced on behalf of Kāinga Ora, MSD, HUD/MCERT or MBIE.
